    <body>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-358-423" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-379-421"><seg source="#source-379-385">一、</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-423-455">ましろき蘆の花噴けば</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-455-487">青き死相を眼にたゝへ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-487-518">大太刀舞はす乱れ髪</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-518-583" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-539-581"><seg source="#source-539-545">二、</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-583-615">白紙を結ぶすはだしや</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-615-641">死を嘲ける青の隈</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-641-673">雪の反射のなかにして</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-673-700">鉄の鏡をかゝげたり</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
